# Testing

Minimum gates: format, lint, unit, integration, contract, migration, SQL validation, dependency scan, secret scan and build.
Critical flows also require E2E, tenant isolation, authorization, audit-log and recovery tests.
Store machine-readable results and a concise verdict under `evidence/releases/<version>/`.
Do not weaken assertions to make a failing test pass.

